        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Holiday on Nonwork Day—When an official Board of Education holiday falls on a unit member's regularly scheduled day off, the unit member is paid for a number of hours equal to his/her regular daily scheduled hours, not to exceed eight (8) hours.",
