        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. A unit member assigned to higher level work for a period of two (2) consecutive work weeks or more shall be paid for all time spent in such higher level work. A unit member's higher level rate shall be determined as if he/she were promoted to the position. A unit member temporarily assigned or detailed to a lower level position shall be paid at his/her own rate.",
